<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Quality%20assurance%20of%20intervention%20using%20systematic%20registration%20on%20individual%20level> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Quality assurance of intervention using systematic registration on individual level" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_table_1/tu_0072> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "All smokers should be professionally encouraged to permanently stop smoking all forms of tobacco. Follow-up, referral to special multidisciplinary programmes and/or pharmacotherapy (including nicotine replacement) are recommended, as a stepwise strategy for smoking cessation. Structured approaches are to be used, for example, 5As: Ask, Advise, Assess, Assist, Arrange" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_table_1/na_0014> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "EXPLICIT_LEXICAL" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Weight%20reduction%20by%20means%20of%20diet%2C%20exercise%20and%20behaviour%20modification.%20It%20is%20recommended%20in%20obese%20patients%20%28BMI%20%5Cgeq%2030%20%5Ctext%7B%20kg%2Fm%7D%5E2%2C%20or%20waist%20circumference%20%5Cgeq%20102%20%5Ctext%7B%20cm%7D%20in%20men%20or%20%5Cgeq%2088%20%5Ctext%7B%20cm%7D%20in%20women%29%2C%20and%20should%20be%20considered%20in%20overweight%20patients%20%28BMI%20%5Cgeq%2025%20%5Ctext%7B%20kg%2Fm%7D%5E2%2C%20or%20waist%20circumference%20%5Cgeq%2094%20%5Ctext%7B%20cm%7D%20in%20men%20or%20%5Cgeq%2080%20%5Ctext%7B%20cm%7D%20in%20women%29%2C%20particularly%20if%20associated%20with%20multiple%20risk%20factors%20%28such%20as%20hypertension%2C%20hypercholesterolemia%2C%20smoking%20and%20insulin%20resistance%20or%20diabetes%29> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceMention> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_table_1/e_0056> .
