<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Education:%20evaluation%20of%20literacy%20level%20and%20type%20of%20communication%20needed%3B%20clear%2C%20comprehensible%20information%20on%20the%20basic%20purpose%20of%20the%20CR%20programme%20and%20the%20role%20of%20each%20component%3B%20information%20and%20education%20on%20perception%20of%20disease%2C%20empowerment%20and%20self-management%3B%20information%20and%20motivation%20on%20target%20lifestyle%20modifications%20and%20pharmacological%20treatment%20targets.%20Personal%20rehabilitation%20goals%20%28apart%20from%20what%20professionals%20set%20as%20a%20target%29%20possibly%20added> <http://digistrucmed.org/name> "Education: evaluation of literacy level and type of communication needed; clear, comprehensible information on the basic purpose of the CR programme and the role of each component; information and education on perception of disease, empowerment and self-management; information and motivation on target lifestyle modifications and pharmacological treatment targets. Personal rehabilitation goals (apart from what professionals set as a target) possibly added" .
