<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_0074e29f31a1f0feb082e0064bee46f60bf6b5ae3f8703d1231341374ed97e52_table_1/na_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "SOURCE_STYLE_RULE" .
