<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Peak%20exercise%20capacity:%20symptom-limited%20exercise%20testing%2C%20either%20on%20bicycle%20ergometer%20or%20on%20treadmill%2C%20by%20means%20of%20CPET%20as%20a%20gold%20standard.%20If%20the%20patient%20cannot%20do%20any%20treadmill%20or%20bicycle%20%28not%20so%20frequent%29%20a%20test%20like%206MWT%20or%20ISWT%20should%20be%20performed%20%28but%20only%20as%20necessary%20alternative%29.%20In%20frail%20patients%20or%20patients%20unable%20to%20walk%2C%20the%20SPPB%20or%20other%20chair%20based%20tests%20should%20be%20considered.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peak exercise capacity: symptom-limited exercise testing, either on bicycle ergometer or on treadmill, by means of CPET as a gold standard. If the patient cannot do any treadmill or bicycle (not so frequent) a test like 6MWT or ISWT should be performed (but only as necessary alternative). In frail patients or patients unable to walk, the SPPB or other chair based tests should be considered." .
